 "remarks": "Welcome to this completely renovated home in the heart of downtown Stamford. Be the first to live here after such extensive upgrades were completed. The upgrades are numerous, featuring a kitchen with new appliances, cabinetry, backsplash, counters, and more! The bathroom has been beautifully designed to the last detail. Professionally refinished hardwood floors shine throughout the home. A custom walk-in closet was added to the 2nd bedroom. All new blinds complete the list of final touches. You'll notice the abundance of light in the living room which then flows throughout the bedrooms as the day continues. On-site laundry for your convenience. Heat & hot water are included in the rent.   Step outside and enjoy everything- restaurants, cafes, night life, shoppping, public library, and so much more. The Avon and Palace theaters are just steps away. The Metro North is within a walk, making for an easy commute. The Bedford Street Garage is close to the building and offers monthly parking passes. Prime downtown location.",
